    "body": "Significantly improves loadtxoutset performance via a number of changes:\n\n * parallel threads for decoding, hashing, serializing and writing to leveldb\n * no fsync() gating writes\n * no redundant loading into CoinsView\n \nAlso adds a subcommand to bitcoin-util for getting a snapshot's hash_serialized_3, muhash, coin count and total amount values without importing to leveldb first.\n\nOn my systems, performance ends up bottlenecked by leveldb CPU usage.",
