      "message": "refactor: Move SnapshotMetadata out of node/\n\nThe snapshot file format is not node state: reading a snapshot needs no\nchainstate, so move it out. This prepares the way for adding snapshot\nparsing to bitcoin-util in a future commit.\n\nMostly move-only. The commit can be reviewed with the\n--color-moved=dimmed-zebra option for an easier review.",
