      "message": "refactor: Check the snapshot network in the caller\n\nSnapshotMetadata took the expected network in its constructor and compared\nit while parsing, throwing on mismatch. Split that check out as a separate\n`CheckNetwork` method, so that callers have the option to read snapshots\nfor arbitrary networks.\n\nAlso replace the per-object `const std::set` for checking supported\nversions with an inline function.",
