      "message": "dbwrapper: Add nosync option for quickly populating a db\n\nNormally, we want updates to the database to be fsynced to disk so that\nthe database is in a consistent state even after a crash. This adds an\noption to drop that guarantee, in favour of faster bulk writes, relying\non the caller to make other arrangements to ensure the resulting database\nis flushed to disk.",
      "committer": {
