      "message": "utxo_snapshot: More efficient snapshot imports\n\nAllows importing snapshots directly into leveldb (dbwrapper), without\npassing through Chainstate or CoinsView first. Supports multithreaded\nprocessing, with one thread reading, one thread hashing, one thread\nserializing for the database, and one thread populating the database.\n\nAdds an additional check that the coins in the snapshot are sorted in\ntxid order.\n\nNothing calls it yet, so behaviour is unchanged.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Anthony Towns",
        "email": "aj@erisian.com.au",
        "date": "2026-10-22T08:20:35Z"
