      "message": "validation: Make ActivateSnapshot faster\n\nActivateSnapshot and, therefore, the loadtxoutset RPC now use the new\nutxo_snapshot.cpp pipeline.\n\nThe dump is no longer staged in a CCoinsViewCache and then hashed and\nflushed out of it, so `-dbcache` worth of cached coins during a mainnet\nload are gone along with the flush cycles. In addition, the hashing\nof the dump takes place in parallel with the import, rather than after\nit completes.\n\nThe old loader is left in place until the next commit removes it;\nnothing calls it any more.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Anthony Towns",
        "email": "aj@erisian.com.au",
        "date": "2026-10-22T08:22:48Z"
      },
