      "body": "The performance change I see on a Ryzen 9 3900X system with RAID HDD storage is ~11minutes with to ~2m for a load, consisting of 1m40s of CPU time followed by 20s of disk flushing; with SSD and a slightly faster CPU, total time is reduced to ~1m, with no significant flush delay after the CPU work is completed. These numbers are with the block 965000 utxo set.",
